{{!
    @template theme_learnovatheme/site_admin_section

    One Site administration card: an admin category rendered as a collapsible
    header plus a 3-column grid of its pages. Included from the Learnova
    override of core/settings_link_page with an admin_category navigation_node
    as its context.

    data-key carries the node key so SCSS can pick the card's icon and tint;
    unmapped keys fall back to a neutral default.

    Every displayed child gets exactly one tile, whether it is a settings page
    or a nested category — the admin tree runs four levels deep (Plugins >
    Activity modules > Assignment > Submission plugins > ...) and flattening
    that would bury a hundred plugin settings in one card. A nested category
    links to its own category.php listing instead, which keeps this page an
    outline of where settings live rather than the settings themselves.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "key": "accounts",
        "text": "Accounts",
        "display": true,
        "children": [
            {
                "text": "Browse list of users",
                "key": "editusers",
                "display": true,
                "action": "https://example.com/admin/user.php",
                "children": []
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<section class="lsa-section" data-key="{{key}}">
    <button type="button" class="lsa-section__hd" aria-expanded="true">
        <span class="lsa-section__ico" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="lsa-section__name">{{text}}</span>
        <span class="lsa-section__chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </button>
    <div class="lsa-section__items">
        {{#children}}
            {{#display}}
                {{#action}}<a class="lsa-item" href="{{{action}}}">{{text}}</a>{{/action}}
            {{/display}}
        {{/children}}
    </div>
</section>
